   "definitions": [
    "class consensus.leios.VoteAggregationDefect"
   ],
   "reason": "the Leios voting's Scala plumbing with no counterpart of its own: the companion of the decisions, a voting key kept with the verification key derived from it once (deriveVerKeyDSIGN in goVote), the capability goVote runs over and the view of the selection it reads (the reference's forker at the volatile tip), the typed outcome of decideLeiosCertify (the reference returns Maybe and traces), and the defects that are the reference's error calls (decideLeiosCertify's on genesis its own) or a native library failure (#54)"
  }
 ],
